# Wave T40 (Clover kit): cloverbed (prop) — a clipped clover mound: dense three-lobe leaves in layered greens with white blossom dots, a low dome standing on the lawn. Seats on Clover's open corners — the painting's clover-flecked lawns carried to garden mounds. Fully opaque, town grass baked in (measured engine tg #178913). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T40-CLOVER-PLAN.md §5.)
